Employee Data Summary – Excel

📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing employee data based on department, job role, and salary using Microsoft Excel.

It was completed as part of the Data Analytics Internship at VEDA Technology (Level 1 – Day 31).

🎯 Objective

To perform grouped workforce analysis and understand employee distribution and salary patterns across different departments and roles.

🛠️ Tools Used

- Microsoft Excel
- PivotTables
- Charts & Data Visualization

📊 Key Tasks Performed

- Created an Employee Summary Sheet.
- Analyzed department-wise employee counts.
- Performed role-wise employee analysis.
- Analyzed salary distribution.
- Compared average and median salaries.
- Created 3 charts to visualize insights.

📈 Deliverables

1. Employee Summary Sheet
2. Three Data Visualization Charts
3. Department-wise Analysis
4. Job Role Analysis
5. Salary Analysis

💡 Key Learnings

- Practical use of Excel PivotTables.
- Grouped workforce analysis.
- Understanding salary distribution.
- Comparing average and median values.
- Creating meaningful charts from employee data.

